    {
      "id": 54634,
      "name": "Wendell",
      "username": "Wendell",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/w/e9bcb4/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-03-29T21:56:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hey NicoF, where do you want the games delivered?</p><p>In this Spain-based online shop, they have everything right now, including the first two expansions and the mini-expansions:</p><p><a href=\"http://www.planetongames.com/advanced_search_result.php?search_in_description=1&amp;keywords=sentinels&amp;x=-501&amp;y=-221&amp;inc_subcat=1\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.planetongames.com/advanced_search_result.php?search_in_description=1&amp;keywords=sentinels&amp;x=-501&amp;y=-221&amp;inc_subcat=1</a></p><p>These are their conditions for international customers (it is a case by case scenario, so you will need to talk with them):</p><p><a href=\"http://www.planetongames.com/international.php\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.planetongames.com/international.php</a></p><p>Apart from that, I have bougth shattered timelines from here&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.shop4de.com/search/sentinels\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.shop4de.com/search/sentinels</a>. They ship to germany only for one euro. They have not restocked the first two expansions though...</p><p>In any case, good luck!</p>",
